@startuml
component "Backend Service & NNE Extension Layer" as compbackendservice
component "Dataset & Preprocessing Pipeline" as compdatasetmanager
component "GPU Acceleration & Hardware Abstraction" as compgpuacceleration
component "Inference Execution Engine" as compinferenceengine
component "Model Registry & Initializer" as compmodelregistry
component "Runtime Monitor & Fault Handler" as compmonitoringfaulthandler
component "SQLite Persistence & Backup Manager" as comppersistencemanager
component "Security & Data Protection Guard" as compsecurityprivacy
component "Training & Evaluation Engine" as comptrainingengine
component "Visual Front-End Interface" as compvisualfrontend
compbackendservice --> compdatasetmanager : Invokes dataset loading, preprocessing, and batch pipeline creation.
compbackendservice --> compinferenceengine : Dispatches inference workflows and receives forward prediction outputs or failure reports.
compbackendservice --> compmodelregistry : Requests model template retrieval, structure instantiation, and parameter initialization.
compbackendservice --> comppersistencemanager : Reads and writes model configurations, dataset metadata, and backup snapshots.
compbackendservice --> comptrainingengine : Triggers training jobs, sends termination signals, and queries training status.
compinferenceengine --> compgpuacceleration : Leverages accelerated forward-pass computation on available GPU hardware.
compinferenceengine --> comppersistencemanager : Stores inference execution records and access logs.
compmonitoringfaulthandler --> compgpuacceleration : Tracks GPU health, memory utilization, and hardware-level failures.
compmonitoringfaulthandler --> comptrainingengine : Monitors training execution states and captures runtime exceptions.
compmonitoringfaulthandler --> compvisualfrontend : Sends troubleshooting guidelines, runtime alerts, and error summaries to the UI.
compsecurityprivacy --> comppersistencemanager : Applies integrity verification and encryption mechanisms to persisted models and database records.
comptrainingengine --> compgpuacceleration : Offloads matrix calculations and tensor optimizations to detected GPU resources.
comptrainingengine --> comppersistencemanager : Saves trained weights, checkpoints, metrics, and execution history.
compvisualfrontend --> compbackendservice : Transfers user configuration, execution commands, and visualization data requests via REST/WebSocket APIs.
@enduml
